OL,3,GNEWSADriver dies in crash involving two
OL,4,Acars                                   
OL,6,FA man has died after two cars crashed  
OL,7,Fon a main road.                        
OL,9,FThe collision, involving a white Omoda 
OL,10,F7 and a silver Honda Jazz, happened on 
OL,11,Fthe A415 between Standlake and Witney, 
OL,12,Fin Oxfordshire, just before 09:30 GMT, 
OL,13,Fsaid Thames Valley Police.             
OL,15,FThe driver of the Honda, a man aged in 
OL,16,Fhis 60s, died at the scene, the force  
OL,17,Fconfirmed. His next of kin have been   
OL,18,Finformed.                              
